# Keep LF everywhere, on Windows too.
#
# Git's default on Windows rewrites checked-out files to CRLF, which
# would reach the Perl scripts in tools/ -- a shebang line ending in
# CR is a real problem the moment one of them runs anywhere but here.
# The app's own files are served to browsers, which do not care, but
# a repository with two line endings in it produces diffs that are
# entirely whitespace.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Pack shots are binary and must never be touched.
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
